# OPERATIONS §2.3 (M3) with §2 "For all three" (a joint model's members found from its use lines, each checked
# against its pin, L §6.1): the member m matches its pin but doesn't load (a figure in an ask, LOAD-LITERAL), so the
# joint model doesn't: its one line, a member's as `refused: member <a>: …` (§2.1), and nothing more; exit 1.
=== options check exit=1
=== j.tally
model j
  tally 2
